<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>MoneyTrack | Personal Finance Tracker</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style5.css">
  <script src="script5.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="logo" href="#dashboard"><span class="brand-icon">₦</span><span >MoneyTrack</span></a>
    <nav class="navigation" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#dashboard">▦ <span>Dashboard</span></a>
    <a  href="#transactions">↔ <span>Transactions</span></a>
        <a  href="#budget">◷ <span>Budget</span></a>
      <a href="#categories">▥ <span>Categories</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section id="dashboard" class="page-section">
      <div class="welcome">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">YOUR MONEY, AT A GLANCE</p>
          <h1>Good day Temi!<span>👋</span></h1>
          <p>Keep track of what comes in, what goes out, and what you have left.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="summary-grid">
        <article class="summary-card">
              <p><span>↗</span></p>
          <p>Total Income</p>
          <h2 id="total-income">₦0.00</h2>
        </article>
        <article class="summary-card">
              <p><span>↘</span></p>
          <p>Total Expenses</p>
          <h2 id="total-expenses">₦0.00</h2>
        </article>
        <article class="summary-card">
              <p><span>◎</span></p>
          <p>Current Balance</p>
          <h2 id="current-balance">₦0.00</h2>
        </article>
        <article class="summary-card">
              <p><span>◈</span></p>
          <p>Budget Remaining</p>
          <h2 id="budget-remaining">₦50,000.00</h2>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="transactions" class="page-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">RECORD YOUR MONEY</p>
          <h2>Add a transaction</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form id="transaction-form" class="panel form-grid">
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="transaction-type">Transaction type</label>
          <select id="transaction-type" required>
            <option value="expense">Expense</option>
            <option value="income">Income</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="description">Description</label>
          <input id="description" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Groceries or Salary" required>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="amount">Amount (₦)</label>
          <input id="amount" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" placeholder="0.00" required>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="date">Date</label>
          <input id="date" type="date" required>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="category">Category</label>
          <select id="category" required>
            <option value="Food">Food</option>
            <option value="Transport">Transport</option>
            <option value="Bills">Bills</option>
            <option value="Education">Education</option>
            <option value="Salary">Salary</option>
            <option value="Shopping">Shopping</option>
            <option value="Health">Health</option>
            <option value="Other">Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <button class="button" type="submit">+ Add transaction</button>
      </form>

      <div class="section-heading history-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">YOUR RECORDS</p>
          <h2>Transaction history</h2>
        </div>
        <button id="clear-transactions" class="button button-light" type="button">Clear all</button>
      </div>
      <div class="panel table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Description</th>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Date</th>
              <th>Type</th>
              <th>Amount</th>
              <th>Action</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="transaction-list">
            <tr><td class="empty-message" colspan="6">No transactions yet. Add one above to get started.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="budget" class="page-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">PLAN AHEAD</p>
          <h2>Monthly budget</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel budget-panel">
        <label for="monthly-budget">Set your monthly spending budget (₦)</label>
        <div class="budget-controls">
          <input id="monthly-budget" type="number" min="0" step="100" value="50000">
          <button id="save-budget" class="button" type="button">Save budget</button>
        </div>
        <div class="budget-details">
          <span>Expenses: <strong id="budget-spent">₦0.00</strong></span>
          <span>Budget: <strong id="budget-total">₦50,000.00</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-track" aria-label="Budget used">
          <div id="budget-progress" class="progress-bar"></div>
        </div>
            <div class="budget-progress">
              <div class="progress-label"><span>Budget used</span><strong id="budgetPercent">0%</strong></div>
        <p id="budget-message" class="budget-message">You are within your budget.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="categories" class="page-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">SEE THE PATTERN</p>
          <h2> your Expenses </h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="category-breakdown" class="category-grid">
        <p class="panel empty-category">Your expense categories will appear here when you add expenses.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <section class="tip-card">
            <div class="tip-star">✦</div>
            <h2>Money tip</h2>
            <p>Give every naira a purpose. Track your spending to understand where your money goes.</p>
          </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>MoneyTrack — a simple way to understand your money.
    @copyright,temi!2026</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
